CORE
contract.sol
--contract ExactR2 --solidity-path-coverage --solidity-max-tx 1 --path-cov-assert spec.json
^--path-cov-assert: unit 'sol:@C@ExactR2@F@get#[0-9]+' -- established 0 relation-backed entry assignment\(s\), assumed 1 region bound\(s\) \(0 hole\(s\) punched\) at entry and emitted 2 candidate assertion\(s\), 2 of them over the unit's own RETURN VALUE
^--path-cov-assert: region NON-VACUITY witnessed
^--path-cov-assert: return: a value IS returned on this path \(REFUTED == yes\)  REFUTED
^--path-cov-assert: return: return == state\.owner  HOLDS$
^--path-cov-assert: ladder summary -- 2 candidate\(s\): 1 HOLDS, 1 REFUTED, 0 no verdict \(solver unknown\), 0 no verdict \(never reached the solver\)
\A(?!(.|\n)*^--path-cov-assert: return: return == 0)
\A(?!(.|\n)*^--path-cov-assert: return: return != 0)
